                            {
                                "example_id": "66bbb13d-6b12-4157-aa88-d927c9c3bf96",
                                "sense_id": "cc33cc54-c060-36d7-ae5b-a19d75b4d206",
                                "text": "Nie wiem skad w ogole ludziom legna sie w glowach takie pomysly. Toz to czysty bareizm:) Juz widze jak pasazerowie pukaja sie w glowe a media maja polewke:)",
                                "translation": "I have no idea how people cook up these ideas. It's pure Bareiism:) I can see that the passengers are hitting their heads and the media was giggling.",
